<title>GERMANY: ABB 1996 dividend unchanged at 19.25 DM.</title>
<headline>ABB 1996 dividend unchanged at 19.25 DM.</headline>
<dateline>MANNHEIM, Germany 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>German engineering group ABB AG said on Thursday its management would propose a 1996 dividend of 19.25 marks on its five-mark shares, unchanged from the year before.</p>
<p>On its 100-mark profit-sharing certificates, ABB will pay 61.60 marks, also unchanged, it said.</p>
<p>The company's annual news conference is scheduled for March 26.</p>
<p>-- Terence Gallagher, Bonn newsroom, 49-228-26097150</p>
